    <guid isPermaLink="false">6900433a5ef42c227b0189b7</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 28 Oct 2025 04:26:36 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这一期聊得比较硬核，从国家的债务问题聊到未来AI的社会，时长几乎两小时。如果你“不堪重负”，可以移步微信公众号阅读文字版干货。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> AI产业的泡沫化引发了思考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="560">09:20</a> 以债务驱动的发展模式走到了尽头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2287">38:07</a>不发展AI行不行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2939">48:59</a> 如何理解AI</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3689">61:29</a> AI会取代哪些职业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4456">74:16</a> AI会取代/赋能哪些公司</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5111">85:11</a> AI如何改变国际局势</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5618">93:38</a> 个人在未来如何生存</span></p><span></span><p><span>YouTube：<a data-url="https://youtu.be/_17VQh5aAgY" href="https://youtu.be/_17VQh5aAgY">youtu.be</a></span><br><span>bilibili：<a data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV16gyqBjEKz" href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV16gyqBjEKz">www.bilibili.com</a></span><br><span>小宇宙/苹果播客：朋友，好久不见</span><br><span>微信公众号：邢嘉源（本期文字版 </span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/inW50dOtYhXVqaqbz80OLA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/inW50dOtYhXVqaqbz80OLA"><span>mp.weixin.qq.com</span></a><span>）</span></p>]]></description>
