    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> Intro 原来看罗永浩的我是在看暴力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="188">03:08</a> 输入的内容反映了背后的欲望</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="348">05:48</a> 色欲（青楼头牌，岛国明星）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="490">08:10</a> 娱乐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="558">09:18</a> 暴力（斗兽场，校园霸凌，竞技性运动）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="950">15:50</a> 被看见（叛逆少年，网络言论，奇怪老人）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1284">21:24</a> 求知欲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1452">24:12</a> 食欲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1580">26:20</a> 基因里的欲望强于后天塑造的欲望</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1652">27:32</a> 网红是大众欲望的集合体</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1798">29:58</a> 网红是一种有价值的商品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1894">31:34</a> 超级英雄是欲望的叠加</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2016">33:36</a> 语言、宗教也是网红</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2158">35:58</a> papi酱超强的感知大众欲望并具像化的能力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2238">37:18</a> 钱和爱是各种欲望的集合</span></p>]]></description>
